  m_Name: Note_CrewmateStartIsland
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  NoteName: Island Note
  NoteHeader: Crewmate's Diary (2/3)
  NoteText: "We're running out of resources, and everyone's starting to get antsy.
    \n\nI think some of them are hallucinating, talking to people who aren't there..
    and to top it off, we found this dead fish, and it had tusks.. and all that did
    was egg them on, got them talking about a sign from a higher power.\n\nThis nightmare
    is changing them. I cant trust them anymore..\n<color=#DED2BD><size=80%>Don't
    trust the fish\nDont trUst the Fish\nDoNt TrUst thE fish\ndonT truSt the fiSh\ndOn\"t
    rust the Pish\ndo not trust the fish.\nDon't trust the Fish.\nIt is not what
    it seems.\nDont trust the fish."
